        "created_at": "2013-03-01T06:52:10.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Damn you Cosmic Omnitron. &nbsp;Tempest, Expatriette and Argent Adept vs Omnitron in Insula Primalis. &nbsp;Started out well. &nbsp;Blasted Sedative Flechettes laid waste to our setups and it was all downhill from there. &nbsp;Managed to get most of our cards back out and even took out two of the bomb cards before they killed us. &nbsp;Then another flechettes card... &nbsp;Expatriette was the first to expire. &nbsp;Then it was adios Argent. &nbsp;Next round Tempest was taken. &nbsp;Omnitron still had 26 hp. &nbsp;I imagine if Omnitron could laugh (can he?) it would sound like that annoying analog screaching you hear when you accidentaly call a fax line.</p>",
        "post_number": 1,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-02-07T01:37:30.248Z",
