        "cooked": "<p>&nbsp;</p><p>Sedative Flechettes is one of those cards that, when it comes around, everyone at the table just weeps bitter tears.</p><p>Devastating Aurora does much the same thing to us, as does Technological Singularity.</p><p>At least Apostate has the decency to give you a go-round before ushering in the Apocalypse!</p>",
